# The project archives are zips, which Prettier does not parse, so they need no entry.
# Two lines were removed here: `public/rubato` and `public/RUBATO.ZIP`, left over from a
# vendored 1990s HTML bundle no longer in the tree. The second was the reason the Rubato
# archive is now `public/rubato-project.zip` rather than `rubato.zip` -- macOS is
# case-insensitive, so the old uppercase name and the plain lowercase one are a single
# path, and restoring the former would have overwritten the reconstruction.

# The verbatim extraction of CHRISTIE.ARJ, kept at the repo root and gitignored. Listed
# here as well because a future Prettier may stop reading .gitignore by default, and a
# reflow of 1987 lex grammars and 6809 assembly would be silent.
/christie

